int numMics = 2;
double micsTotalCost = numMics * mic.getPrice();

int numSpeakers = 3;
double speakersTotalCost = numSpeakers * speaker.getPrice();
```

Step 4: Calculate the total cost
Add up the total costs of all product types to get the grand total.

```java
double totalCost = headphonesTotalCost + micsTotalCost + speakersTotalCost;
```

